  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plan Norge- Girls Get Equal: realising rights building resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescent girls and young women aged 10-24 are empowered, resilient and exercise their rights. Research and evaluation of the programme&apos;s approaches for and results of quality inclusive education, household economic empowerment, sexual and reproductive health and rights and meaningful youth engagement for adolescent girls and young women, their families and communities so that they are empowered, have increased resilience towards climate change effects and other shocks and stresses and exercise their rights in contexts challenged by gender norms, harmful practices and poverty</narrative>
  </description>
